# 2. Primary Business Purpose

The simulator represents the downstream system responsible for managing accounts and earmarking/reserving funds.

The primary lifecycle is:

```text
Account
   ↓
Available Funds
   ↓
Pre-Fund Reservation Request
   ↓
Validate Account
   ↓
Validate Available Funds
   ↓
Create Earmark
   ↓
Reservation Response
   ↓
Vendor Acknowledgement
   ↓
Reservation Confirmation
   ↓
Settlement
   ↓
Consume / Release Earmark
   ↓
Final Account State
```

The exact accounting treatment of settlement must be configurable to match the actual downstream system contract.

