# 6. Important Reservation Rule

Reservation must be **atomic**.

Example:

```text
Account balance = $100,000

Reservation = $20,000
```

Transaction:

```text
BEGIN

Lock Account

Check Available Balance

Create Reservation

Increase ReservedBalance

COMMIT
```

Result:

```text
Ledger       $100,000
Reserved      $20,000
Available     $80,000
```

Two concurrent requests must not be allowed to reserve the same available funds.

Use database transaction + row-level locking/optimistic concurrency.

