# 7. Reservation Scenarios

The simulator should allow:

### Successful

```text
Request
   ↓
Account Valid
   ↓
Sufficient Funds
   ↓
RESERVED
```

### Insufficient Funds

```text
Request
   ↓
Available < Requested
   ↓
REJECTED
INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
```

### Invalid Account

```text
Account not found
       ↓
INVALID_ACCOUNT
```

### Duplicate

```text
Same RequestId
       ↓
DUPLICATE_REQUEST
```

### Simulated Technical Failure

```text
Request
   ↓
Configured Failure
   ↓
TECHNICAL_ERROR
```

