# 9. Settlement Processing

For a successful settlement:

```text
Reservation
     │
     ▼
SETTLEMENT_REQUEST
     │
     ▼
Validate Reservation
     │
     ▼
Consume Earmark
     │
     ▼
Update Account
     │
     ▼
SETTLED
```

The exact accounting treatment should be configurable because your real downstream system may treat the earmark differently.

For example:

```text
Before:

Ledger       $100,000
Reserved      $20,000
Available     $80,000

Settlement:

Ledger        $80,000
Reserved       $0
Available     $80,000
```

or another configured accounting model.

The simulator should make this behavior explicit rather than hard-code assumptions.

